evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-1.md:8:Before coding EACH card capture real printing data from Scryfall API (GET cards/named exact then a concrete set/collector printing) or official Gatherer. Save source fields and retrieval date; no invented provenance. Python stdlib urllib and JSON can collect it; honor API pacing. A card with absent/unsupported printed text is not a vanilla. Avoid keyword/ability implementation in this slice unless essential. Jasmine is genuinely printed vanilla legendary creature; extend supported commander registry from Isamaru in a typed bounded manner while preserving current practice defaults and refusing commander-only legends in ordinary libraries. Preserve save/replay compatibility; no state fields unless needed. Detect any hardcoded pool size/test assumptions and update truthful assertions, never weaken behavioral guarantees.
evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-1.md:10:Coordinator decisions for long-term corpus: eight target ids/names = isamaru-white-aggro (Isamaru, Hound of Konda); jasmine-vanilla-stompy (Jasmine Boreal); talrand-draw-go (Talrand, Sky Summoner); krenko-goblin-tokens (Krenko, Mob Boss); ayula-bear-counters (Ayula, Queen Among Bears); elas-sacrifice (Elas il-Kor, Sadistic Pilgrim); tatyova-landfall (Tatyova, Benthic Druid); zada-spells (Zada, Hedron Grinder). Only Jasmine targeted for implementation now. Do not claim others supported. Create docs/issue17-starter-corpus.md explaining target archetypes, phased gaps, exclusion policy. Exact desired future lists should be represented only when real sourced lists can be constructed; report unresolved desired lists honestly. Manifest schema JSON under decks/starter-corpus/manifest.json: version=1, starters array with id, commander, style, status ('planned'|'implemented'|'certified'), deck_path nullable, missing_cards array, missing_interactions array. First exact text library lives decks/starter-corpus/jasmine-vanilla-stompy.txt (99 library cards excluding separately specified commander). Machine metadata under fixtures/starter-corpus/ binds exact list and sourced cards using existing offline analyzer schema, not a new permissive parallel legality engine. Distinguish format legality/support/gameplay. Do not alter existing analyzer blanket gameplay refusal merely to get a green report.
evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-1.md:12:TDD: genuine failing regression before production edit for each new mechanic/registry change; record command+expected failure in evidence/issue17/TDD.md. For bulk vanilla cards use a data-driven sourced catalog conformance test checking each card's name/cost/type/power/toughness/empty rules and actual cast/resolve behavior, not just count. New commander must cast, command-tax/return and Commander damage use existing paths with focused tests. Retain failures honestly; no retrospective TDD claims. Existing immutable fixtures must still load AND replay with equal digest.
evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-2.md:4:The work order explicitly requires eight named target archetypes AND exact desired lists with a missing-card/interaction manifest before certification. Your first delivered package should stay unchanged except demonstrated defect fixes. Now finish the plan as actual files for the OTHER seven planned starters from coordinator's fixed target names/commanders. Each desired list = 99 library cards + separately named commander, approximately 38-43 basic lands (use legal repeated basics), 56-61 unique nonbasic library names. No eight near-identical land/vanilla piles. Use the chosen archetypes' real synergy cards. Isamaru white aggro; Talrand blue instants/sorceries; Krenko goblin tokens; Ayula bears/counters; Elas WB sacrifice/death triggers; Tatyova UG landfall/ramp; Zada red targeted cantrips/pump/go-wide. These are DESIRED, NOT IMPLEMENTED/SUPPORTED/CERTIFIED. Do NOT implement their new mechanics now.
evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-2.md:6:Source actual cards and costs/types/Oracle text from Scryfall API. To avoid needless 429s, bounded search requests with full real printing records are valid sources; record query URL/retrieval date and per-card printing id/set/collector/URI from the real search response. Do not redundantly fetch every named card if the exact printing response was already captured. Use pacing/backoff. Reject nonnormal layouts, not Commander legal, not in identity, special pregame choices. Select a plausible low/moderate mana curve and enough real synergy cards. Do not invent metadata or call unsourced/planned lists legal. Preserve exact desired list files even if an individual legality check remains not_certified.
evidence/issue17/IMPLEMENT-2.md:10:Update docs/issue17-starter-corpus.md with corpus union size, supported/missing card counts and staged interaction roadmap derived programmatically from these exact desired snapshots. Never mark #17 or any future card package certified from metadata alone. Add one structural regression that verifies exactly eight ids, all 100-card desired lists, singleton/basic exceptions, per-list nonland count, and actual missing names (no invented index counts). Retain a genuine failing test before introducing this manifest behavior. Keep all existing actual package tests green; do not repeat full historical test suite. Write concise assignment2 handoff and then STOP for independent practical review.
